+/* The Teams page: two columns at most, so an even list leaves no hole; a top list opens on its
+   first row's line, not its padding (the block heading's gap); a heading inside a list spans the
+   grid; the group head's count sits at its right. A top list has one view for all regions and one per region; a region filter swaps them
+   (the region rules below hide the other regions' views) and hides the region groups. */
+.teamindex .comp-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, max(280px, calc((100% - 8px) / 2))), 1fr)); }
